WEBVTT

00:16.950 --> 00:18.449
Miyamura!

00:18.450 --> 00:19.450
Eh?

00:21.080 --> 00:22.289
Let me give you a haircut.

00:22.290 --> 00:24.290
Huh? Why?

00:24.540 --> 00:26.999
Hori-san, watch the scissors!

00:27.000 --> 00:29.339
Miyamura, short hair
would definitely suit you.

00:29.340 --> 00:30.839
I told you not to!

00:30.840 --> 00:36.180
Why? Your face is so small and your
hair is so smooth, it's really irritating!

00:37.010 --> 00:39.560
It's definitely too short!
It's pulling my hair!

00:39.850 --> 00:41.469
Quit making such a fuss.

00:41.470 --> 00:43.229
Nooooooo!

00:43.230 --> 00:44.769
This sounds bad!

00:44.770 --> 00:47.439
That's right. The weather
is nice today, isn't it?

00:47.440 --> 00:49.939
The flow of this
conversation is terrifying.

00:49.940 --> 00:53.070
Hori-san and Miyamura-kun
is about to start!

00:53.440 --> 00:53.488
LIVE-EVIL FANSUBS Presents

00:55.820 --> 00:57.819
This is going to be your only appearance.

00:57.820 --> 00:58.160
Eh?

00:58.161 --> 01:00.199
Only the most popular ones get to star.

01:00.200 --> 01:02.580
Eh? Ehhhhhh?!

01:21.560 --> 01:23.390
The new school year starts today.

01:24.230 --> 01:26.809
Compared to when we were just admitted,

01:26.810 --> 01:29.980
going back as a third year
student doesn't really feel special.

01:32.440 --> 01:36.529
Now it just feels like spring
break ended too soon.

01:36.530 --> 01:40.030
Well, it's not like I really
had high hopes or anything...

01:41.080 --> 01:42.740
But this year...

02:14.360 --> 02:15.490
Good morning.

02:16.150 --> 02:18.069
Ah, Hori, good morning.

02:18.070 --> 02:19.159
What class are you in?

02:19.160 --> 02:21.489
I'm in Class 1. Hori, you're with me.

02:21.490 --> 02:23.160
Really? Yay!

02:26.160 --> 02:29.289
But I don't see Tooru's name anywhere.

02:29.210 --> 02:29.248
Hori Kyouko

02:29.210 --> 02:29.248
Mizouchi Taiki

02:29.290 --> 02:32.290
It's there. I'm also in Class 1.

02:32.249 --> 02:32.290
Furuda Mina

02:32.249 --> 02:32.290
Miyamura Izumi

02:34.300 --> 02:35.510
Sorry.

02:40.470 --> 02:44.889
Ah... Miyamura is in the same class as us.

02:44.890 --> 02:47.480
He looks like an otaku as usual.

02:50.100 --> 02:52.440
Ah, Hori-san. Good morning.

02:52.860 --> 02:53.770
Good morning.

02:53.771 --> 02:54.859
Good morning, Yuki.

02:54.860 --> 02:56.029
Hey~

02:56.030 --> 02:58.439
Hori, show me your notes again.

02:58.440 --> 03:00.819
Hey, do them yourself.

03:00.820 --> 03:02.660
Are the seats assigned?

03:08.870 --> 03:11.079
N-Nice to meet you.

03:11.080 --> 03:11.750
Yeah...

03:11.751 --> 03:12.999
Hori~!

03:13.000 --> 03:15.419
I'm glad my seat is close to yours.

03:15.420 --> 03:17.460
The three of us are back together again.

03:20.510 --> 03:22.799
I get it...

03:22.800 --> 03:25.180
Good morning. Everyone,
please take your seats.

03:26.600 --> 03:30.729
I'm the homeroom teacher
for Class 1, Terajima.

03:30.730 --> 03:32.729
I'll also be your chemistry teacher.

03:32.730 --> 03:34.559
Nice to meet you all.

03:34.560 --> 03:37.019
OK, so this is the plan for today.

03:37.020 --> 03:40.240
At 9, we'll start working...

03:38.740 --> 03:38.860
You forgot this.

03:45.700 --> 03:49.449
My... no, our secret...

03:49.450 --> 03:52.250
I'm home!

03:52.290 --> 03:53.750
Welc-

03:54.250 --> 03:55.629
What happened to you?!

03:55.630 --> 03:56.630
I fell.

03:56.960 --> 03:58.499
Geez!

03:58.500 --> 04:00.170
U-Um...

04:04.220 --> 04:07.010
A dog startled him and he fell.

04:07.680 --> 04:09.679
You came here just because of that?

04:09.680 --> 04:11.729
Souta-kun is a pretty responsible kid.

04:11.730 --> 04:14.439
He was able to properly tell
me his name and address.

04:14.440 --> 04:17.019
He must get it from you.

04:17.020 --> 04:19.819
No... not really...

04:19.820 --> 04:23.649
It's pretty amazing that you take
care of the house all by yourself.

04:23.650 --> 04:25.529
I'm impressed, Hori-san.

04:25.530 --> 04:26.740
No...

04:28.660 --> 04:30.700
Huh? It's Hori-san, right?

04:31.620 --> 04:36.290
U-Um yeah, it's Hori, but...
Do you go to the same school?

04:36.960 --> 04:39.000
We're in the same class. I'm Miyamura.

04:39.000 --> 04:43.010
- - It's fine. I'm just going to go sit in this
corner, so don't worry about it. It's fine.

04:39.500 --> 04:42.010
Same class... That... Miyamura...

04:43.800 --> 04:46.339
Having a different hairstyle
can really change a person.

04:46.340 --> 04:47.680
You too.

04:47.680 --> 04:51.180
- - I'm sorry, but please
don't change the topic to me.

04:47.680 --> 04:51.180
I'm sorry, but please don't
change the topic to me.

04:48.890 --> 04:50.260
"You too."

04:51.640 --> 04:53.639
You must care a lot about your home.

04:53.640 --> 04:56.189
S-Stop it.

04:56.190 --> 04:59.525
I haven't even let Yuki
see me without makeup.

04:59.526 --> 05:01.709
Onii-chan, I don't understand this puzzle.

05:01.710 --> 05:02.710
Let me see.

05:04.110 --> 05:05.030
Where?

05:05.031 --> 05:06.279
Here.

05:06.280 --> 05:08.950
Ah, the piece is upside down.

05:10.160 --> 05:12.119
Thanks for the food!

05:12.120 --> 05:13.450
Are you sure it's OK...

05:13.750 --> 05:16.960
It's fine, one extra person
isn't going to make a difference.

05:17.540 --> 05:19.169
Besides, I already made it.

05:19.170 --> 05:20.460
It's good.

05:23.050 --> 05:24.420
Thanks for the food.

05:26.300 --> 05:27.839
You're right, it's delicious.

05:27.840 --> 05:29.390
Isn't it?

05:30.510 --> 05:33.099
You should always wear your hair like this.

05:33.100 --> 05:33.930
Your glasses too.

05:33.931 --> 05:37.269
Yeah, but my piercings stand out.

05:37.270 --> 05:39.939
You look cuter without your makeup.

05:39.940 --> 05:40.900
Huh?

05:40.901 --> 05:42.230
That face.

05:44.320 --> 05:45.650
What face?

05:49.410 --> 05:50.779
Thanks again for the food.

05:50.780 --> 05:53.410
Come over again, Onii-chan.

05:54.660 --> 05:58.710
I didn't think that there'd be a next time.

06:06.670 --> 06:11.759
S-Souta said that he wants to play
with you again, so maybe next weekend...

06:11.760 --> 06:12.760
A-Are you sure?

06:13.720 --> 06:16.020
I'm not the one asking! Souta is.

06:19.600 --> 06:24.110
After that, I started going to
Hori-san's house on my days off.

06:25.110 --> 06:30.110
Even now those days
continue, but not every day.

06:37.330 --> 06:40.249
Boys shouldn't cry like that, you know.

06:40.250 --> 06:42.339
But you kicked me.

06:42.340 --> 06:44.550
It's called <i>playing the heel</i>.

06:45.130 --> 06:47.549
Why don't you ask your
sister to come save you again?

06:47.550 --> 06:50.130
That's what's called a <i>sister complex</i>.

06:52.850 --> 06:53.760
Onee-

06:53.761 --> 06:55.559
Souta!

06:55.560 --> 06:58.939
It's time to go. We're
going to go to Starbucks.

06:58.940 --> 07:00.730
Onii-chan!

07:02.020 --> 07:04.569
So <i>that's</i> why Souta was with you.

07:04.570 --> 07:05.779
Yeah.

07:05.780 --> 07:08.070
So where's my juice?

07:11.320 --> 07:12.570
Here.

07:18.580 --> 07:19.750
Thanks.

07:24.630 --> 07:27.049
What's this?! It's just a cafe latte!

07:27.050 --> 07:28.629
Eh? You don't like it?

07:28.630 --> 07:31.299
Geez!

07:31.300 --> 07:33.550
I'm gonna go check on Souta.

07:56.830 --> 07:58.450
It's so frustrating...

08:01.120 --> 08:02.920
I think it tastes good.

08:03.960 --> 08:06.630
No... not the heel!

08:11.300 --> 08:12.879
Hori-san, what should I do?

08:12.880 --> 08:14.049
Huh, what?

08:14.050 --> 08:16.180
Today's physical exams.

08:16.550 --> 08:18.140
I told you yesterday.

08:20.220 --> 08:21.220
Come here for a second.

08:23.730 --> 08:25.229
What are we doing here?

08:25.230 --> 08:26.940
What should I do about this?

08:29.360 --> 08:31.529
A tattoo?

08:31.530 --> 08:36.660
I don't know whether to think
you're amazing or a complete idiot.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.909
What are you saying, Hori-san?

08:39.910 --> 08:41.790
Suspension... no, you'll be expelled.

08:42.910 --> 08:46.000
I wonder what that's about.

08:49.000 --> 08:50.840
Village of Bamboo Shoots

08:52.590 --> 08:55.840
These "Village of Bamboo
Shoots" cookies are really good!

09:02.680 --> 09:05.900
I wonder if I can get out of the
examination by yelling sexual harassment.

09:07.230 --> 09:08.480
Miyamura.

09:10.610 --> 09:11.650
What?

09:12.230 --> 09:14.649
Haven't you been pretty
friendly with Hori lately?

09:14.650 --> 09:17.029
R-Really?

09:17.030 --> 09:19.909
A-Are you going out?

09:19.910 --> 09:22.040
No, there's no way...

09:23.580 --> 09:27.790
I thought so. You and
Hori are too different.

09:30.670 --> 09:33.340
Yeah, we wouldn't make a good match.

09:34.260 --> 09:35.839
W-We...

09:35.840 --> 09:37.049
Speak clearly!

09:37.050 --> 09:38.300
S-Sorry.

09:40.890 --> 09:44.390
Ishikawa-kun, could it
be that you like Hori-san?

09:45.350 --> 09:46.890
So what if I do?

09:48.150 --> 09:49.770
Really?

09:48.400 --> 09:49.769
Natural Insensitivity

09:50.150 --> 09:52.019
That's right. So...

09:51.980 --> 09:56.989
Natural Insensitivity

09:52.020 --> 09:55.110
So that's why you're always
staring when I talk to Hori-san...

09:54.486 --> 09:56.990
Full Throttle

09:55.440 --> 09:57.029
Be quiet, idiot!

09:57.030 --> 09:58.949
Oh sorry, it's a secret, huh?

09:58.366 --> 09:59.739
Just plain Insensitive

09:58.950 --> 10:00.409
I'm really sorry...

10:00.410 --> 10:02.079
What are you guys doing?

10:02.080 --> 10:04.250
Gym is next, right? Go get changed.

10:07.250 --> 10:09.129
Well, we're already late as it is.

10:09.130 --> 10:10.499
Let's go.

10:10.500 --> 10:12.290
Whoa, you changed fast!

10:13.630 --> 10:16.669
Hey, I've been thinking...

10:16.670 --> 10:19.180
It's summer, so why are you
wearing winter gym clothes?

10:20.220 --> 10:22.100
I-I'm sensitive to the cold weather.

10:24.560 --> 10:27.600
Don't tell me, you have
a scar or something?

10:28.020 --> 10:29.309
I shouldn't have asked. Sorry.

10:29.310 --> 10:31.520
A-Ah, no it's...

10:33.900 --> 10:39.409
I really shouldn't tell you,
but underneath this jacket...

10:39.410 --> 10:42.739
It could be a real problem
if you tell anyone, OK?

10:42.740 --> 10:47.000
Whoa, what's that? Is it real?

10:48.370 --> 10:49.370
Yeah.

10:49.790 --> 10:54.249
It's true that if you were wearing a
white shirt then you could see through it.

10:54.250 --> 10:56.420
If you're going to hide it,
then why did you get it?

10:56.920 --> 10:59.430
I didn't realize that until after I got it.

11:01.680 --> 11:02.930
No way.

11:03.550 --> 11:05.970
You're kind of interesting.

11:10.310 --> 11:13.940
So Hori likes this kind of face, huh...

11:15.690 --> 11:17.939
You even have piercings?

11:17.940 --> 11:19.320
Shhh!

11:27.790 --> 11:28.790
Hori.

11:31.040 --> 11:32.040
Are you going home?

11:32.420 --> 11:33.420
Yeah.

11:38.260 --> 11:39.509
What?

11:39.510 --> 11:41.379
I wanted to talk to you.

11:41.380 --> 11:42.799
OK.

11:42.800 --> 11:44.259
You're with Tooru?

11:44.260 --> 11:46.140
Um, kind of.

11:46.760 --> 11:48.809
You're avoiding the question.

11:48.810 --> 11:50.849
I-I wasn't trying to...

11:50.850 --> 11:52.450
Look me in the eyes when you talk to me.

11:52.770 --> 11:54.189
No, that's...

11:54.190 --> 11:55.689
What did I do?

11:55.690 --> 11:57.730
Nothing! It's just...

12:00.190 --> 12:04.619
I don't really get it, but take
care of Souta for me. OK?

12:04.620 --> 12:05.819
C'ya later!

12:05.820 --> 12:07.120
Bye!

12:16.500 --> 12:18.500
I'm gonna to confess to
Hori. Is that OK with you?

12:23.010 --> 12:25.390
Why did you check with me?

12:26.050 --> 12:28.429
No, somehow...

12:28.430 --> 12:30.980
Hori-san will make her choice, so...

12:31.600 --> 12:35.729
I'm just grateful that she is nice to me.

12:35.730 --> 12:39.110
We're really nothing more than friends.

12:41.690 --> 12:43.945
New Product

12:42.780 --> 12:44.950
If those two start dating...

12:43.946 --> 12:46.200
Fresh Pudding

12:45.570 --> 12:47.160
where will that leave me?

12:48.530 --> 12:50.080
I'll just be in the way.

13:08.850 --> 13:11.470
Hori Souta.

13:13.350 --> 13:14.730
I'm done, Onii-chan.

13:16.560 --> 13:17.859
Onii-chan?

13:17.860 --> 13:20.649
Y-Yeah... good job.

13:20.650 --> 13:22.610
Can I eat the pudding now?

13:23.650 --> 13:24.650
I'm home.

13:24.651 --> 13:26.160
Onee-chan just came back!

13:26.860 --> 13:32.489
It'll be OK, I'm used to being
alone... it'll be just like before.

13:32.490 --> 13:33.660
That's all.

13:34.160 --> 13:36.249
We're going to eat pudding now.

13:36.250 --> 13:37.330
OK, OK.

13:38.830 --> 13:40.250
Welcome back.

13:43.090 --> 13:44.090
Stop!

13:44.550 --> 13:45.720
It's over, Hariken.

13:46.220 --> 13:47.590
Tooru told me.

13:48.390 --> 13:49.260
Oh?

13:49.261 --> 13:51.060
I wonder what she's going to say.

13:51.720 --> 13:55.770
"Give me back the key," or "You don't
need to come here anymore," or maybe...

13:56.270 --> 13:58.849
D-Did you really say that we don't match?

13:58.850 --> 13:59.850
Huh?

14:00.520 --> 14:06.779
Did you really say that
I'm just being nice to you?

14:06.780 --> 14:08.779
What about Ishikawa-kun?

14:08.780 --> 14:10.659
He told me that you...

14:10.660 --> 14:11.660
He told me...

14:13.290 --> 14:14.410
He told you?

14:16.000 --> 14:17.829
It's just like he said.

14:17.830 --> 14:24.379
I'm dark and plain. I'd just
cause problems for you, I think.

14:24.380 --> 14:26.169
That's why I...

14:26.170 --> 14:28.339
It's not how I really feel though.

14:28.340 --> 14:31.220
I didn't want to blow your cover.

14:32.430 --> 14:33.260
I'm sorry! Are you OK-

14:33.261 --> 14:37.350
Why do you have to care
about covering for me?

14:38.270 --> 14:40.309
Don't say that again!

14:40.310 --> 14:41.360
You idiot!

14:42.270 --> 14:44.530
It's still OK if I come over?

14:45.150 --> 14:47.650
If you stop coming, then Souta would cry!

14:48.070 --> 14:50.319
And it'd be hard for me
to carry groceries alone.

14:50.320 --> 14:52.370
And there would be too many leftovers!

14:55.200 --> 14:57.870
Tooru? Oh I turned him down.

14:58.410 --> 15:00.870
I see. Even though he's a nice guy and all.

15:01.540 --> 15:05.130
Most people like him would be
shocked to see my face without makeup.

15:05.670 --> 15:08.129
Ishikawa-kun wouldn't be shocked.

15:08.130 --> 15:08.970
He's a good guy.

15:08.971 --> 15:10.049
What?

15:10.050 --> 15:12.049
Are you in love with him?

15:12.050 --> 15:13.549
Then why don't you go out with him?

15:13.550 --> 15:14.550
Eh?

15:14.760 --> 15:18.270
Ishikawa-kun is so popular though.
I don't think we'd be a good match.

15:19.940 --> 15:20.940
Eww.

15:25.230 --> 15:26.729
Ah, it's Tooru.

15:26.730 --> 15:27.730
Good morning.

15:29.400 --> 15:30.570
I'm heartbroken right now!

15:32.070 --> 15:33.620
At least say good morning.

15:37.200 --> 15:39.829
It seems like he's avoiding me today.

15:39.830 --> 15:41.829
Isn't it painful for you to talk to him?

15:41.830 --> 15:42.920
Why?

15:44.250 --> 15:45.340
Tooru...

15:46.550 --> 15:49.379
Seems like he doesn't have
a problem with talking to me.

15:49.380 --> 15:52.049
This morning he came up to me and said,

15:52.050 --> 15:56.219
"Good morning, Miyamura.
Did you do the homework?"

15:56.220 --> 15:59.850
It's just like... we're friends.

16:00.850 --> 16:03.099
Miyamura, you skipping class?

16:03.100 --> 16:04.149
Yeah.

16:04.150 --> 16:05.229
Me too.

16:05.230 --> 16:08.069
I'm too tired to run anymore.

16:08.070 --> 16:09.490
You're sweating a lot.

16:10.740 --> 16:11.990
Is this OK?

16:12.990 --> 16:17.489
OK, today we're going to do a report.
You'll be in groups of four.

16:17.490 --> 16:19.200
Decide on groups amongst yourselves.

16:21.960 --> 16:23.669
Yoshikawa, loan me a pen.

16:23.670 --> 16:25.209
You always have plenty, right?

16:25.210 --> 16:26.379
Shut up.

16:26.380 --> 16:28.919
I won't lend one to someone like you.

16:28.920 --> 16:29.590
Stingy.

16:29.591 --> 16:31.191
Does anyone have a blank piece of paper?

16:31.550 --> 16:32.550
No.

16:33.930 --> 16:35.590
I do.

16:36.350 --> 16:37.639
Do we have enough paper?

16:37.640 --> 16:39.309
I have a loose leaf binder with me.

16:39.310 --> 16:41.059
Miyamura, collect all of the materials.

16:41.060 --> 16:42.390
OK.

16:42.850 --> 16:45.269
Hey! That's my eraser.

16:45.270 --> 16:46.559
I'm just borrowing it.

16:46.560 --> 16:48.229
Don't use it too much.

16:48.230 --> 16:49.939
You two never stop.

16:49.940 --> 16:51.070
Friends...

16:51.860 --> 16:55.070
Is this what friends are like?

16:55.530 --> 16:59.539
OK, let's all pair up and hold hands.

16:59.540 --> 17:00.540
OK!

17:01.250 --> 17:02.869
Let's do it.

17:02.870 --> 17:03.710
OK.

17:03.711 --> 17:06.080
Hey, hey, let's hold hands.

17:06.830 --> 17:08.709
Has everyone found a partner?

17:08.710 --> 17:10.130
Yes!

17:19.560 --> 17:21.469
Miyamura, huh?

17:21.470 --> 17:24.560
He's not a bad guy,
he's just a little dark.

17:25.020 --> 17:27.189
Miyamura's alone again.

17:27.190 --> 17:29.400
Someone should let him in their group.

17:33.570 --> 17:36.699
I always thought that was normal for me.

17:36.700 --> 17:38.070
Ah, there you are, Miyamura.

17:38.910 --> 17:40.739
What's up, Ishikawa-kun?

17:40.740 --> 17:43.289
Fifth period got switched
to political science.

17:43.290 --> 17:45.579
I wonder if I brought the textbook.

17:45.580 --> 17:48.080
I wish they'd stop changing things.

17:48.460 --> 17:51.629
Anyway, Hori's the same as always.

17:51.630 --> 17:54.459
Typically a person would become uneasy...

17:54.460 --> 17:57.379
Well, I'm glad she's not doing that.

17:57.380 --> 17:59.380
Does that mean she thinks
nothing of me, I wonder?

18:01.260 --> 18:03.470
Is Ishikawa-kun a friend?

18:04.100 --> 18:05.139
Anyway...

18:05.140 --> 18:07.099
What do you think?

18:07.100 --> 18:08.399
Huh? About what?

18:08.400 --> 18:10.440
Weren't you listening?

18:12.190 --> 18:15.899
Um... what do you think about me?

18:15.900 --> 18:19.280
When you say it like
that... it sounds weird.

18:20.740 --> 18:24.539
And it bothers me that
you're friendly with Hori.

18:24.540 --> 18:27.249
It's irritating when
you don't speak clearly.

18:27.250 --> 18:28.419
Sometimes you act weird.

18:28.420 --> 18:34.049
Also, you're too nice and
gullible. I can't leave you alone.

18:34.050 --> 18:36.799
Without your glasses and a different
hairstyle, you'd be good-looking.

18:36.800 --> 18:37.800
It's irritating.

18:39.130 --> 18:42.639
Making me say all this, that's
what's annoying about you.

18:42.640 --> 18:43.640
Eh?

18:44.140 --> 18:48.519
Also, you're about the only one who
calls me by my last name with -kun.

